    - target: {fileID: 490730504229696493, guid: 3a2fb28952c3a449fb95f1b8fa3b58ed, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "<b>Cucumber salad with sour cream and dill (Gurkensalat mit Sauerrahm
        und Dill)</b>\n\n(servings for 2 people)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<b>Ingredients:</b>\n\n-
        1 cucumbers\n- approx. 1 tsp salt\n- \xBD  bunch of fresh dill\n- 100 g sour
        cream\n- \xBD  garlic clove (large) (optional)\n- 1 tbsp olive oil\n- \xBD 
        tbsp white wine vinegar or other light \n- vinegar / optionally lemon juice\n-
        Salt & pepper\n\n<b>Instructions:</b>\n\n1. Wash the cucumbers and slice
        into very thin slices.\n\n2. Wash the dill and shake dry, remove the leaves
        from the stems and chop finely.\n\n3. For the dressing: Mix the sour cream,
        oil and vinegar in a bowl. \n\n4. Then add the dill and stir in.\nIf desired,
        grate garlic clove and add to the dressing.\n\n5. Add the cucumber slices
        and let it sit."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 490730504229696493, guid: 3a2fb28952c3a449fb95f1b8fa3b58ed, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontStyle
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 983864149759871055, guid: 3a2fb28952c3a449fb95f1b8fa3b58ed, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchoredPosition.x
      value: 21.477661
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1368190937325590760, guid: 3a2fb28952c3a449fb95f1b8fa3b58ed, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_IsActive
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1549446885973540341, guid: 3a2fb28952c3a449fb95f1b8fa3b58ed, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: CucumberSalad
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1549446885973540341, guid: 3a2fb28952c3a449fb95f1b8fa3b58ed, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_IsActive
